title: Conductor v5.7.0 — Daily-Driver Milestone
summary: Conductor transformed from a monorepo-only dev tool into a globally launchable daily-driver macOS app. Global binary install via `paradigm conductor --install`, auto-discovery of ~22 projects from session history, Resume/Open UX for terminal-based session recovery, and instance linking UI for Symphony-backed cross-project collaboration. Built on 20 sprints of existing infrastructure — the gap was access and discoverability, not capability.
